-     detail
+     detail

-         Error `↯/s.102.1`: _service discovery failed because `reason`_. The `#reason` is one of
-         `Discovery.Error.Reason`'s cases, numbered 1 to 6:
+         Ошибка `↯/s.102.1`: _service discovery failed because `reason`_. `#reason` — один из
+         кейсов `Discovery.Error.Reason`, пронумерованных от 1 до 6:

-         ```tabular
+         ```tabular

-         column  Case
-         column  Code
-         column  Message
-         column  Note
-         row  `Conflict(name)`  1  _the name `name` could not be claimed after repeated conflicts_  after a hundred renamings
+         column  Кейс
+         column  Код
+         column  Сообщение
+         column  Примечание
+         row  `Conflict(name)`  1  _the name `name` could not be claimed after repeated conflicts_  после сотни переименований

-         row  `Timeout(instance)`  2  _the instance `instance` did not resolve before the timeout_
+         row  `Timeout(instance)`  2  _the instance `instance` did not resolve before the timeout_

-         row  `InvalidName(text)`  3  _the name `text` is not a valid DNS-SD name_  a label or name is empty, over 63 bytes, or over a DNS limit
-         row  `InvalidTxt(key)`  4  _the TXT entry `key` is not valid_  its key is empty, contains `=` or a non-printable character, or the entry exceeds 255 bytes
-         row  `InvalidService(name)`  5  _the service name `name` is not valid_  empty, over fifteen characters, or beginning with `_`
-         row  `Unavailable`  6  _no service discovery backend could be started_  the transport could not be opened; the responder's own `Mdns.Error` is the cause
+         row  `InvalidName(text)`  3  _the name `text` is not a valid DNS-SD name_  метка или имя пусты, длиннее 63 байтов или выходят за ограничение DNS
+         row  `InvalidTxt(key)`  4  _the TXT entry `key` is not valid_  ключ пуст, содержит `=` или непечатаемый символ, либо запись превышает 255 байтов
+         row  `InvalidService(name)`  5  _the service name `name` is not valid_  пустое, длиннее пятнадцати символов или начинается с `_`
+         row  `Unavailable`  6  _no service discovery backend could be started_  транспорт не удалось открыть; причиной служит собственная `Mdns.Error` респондера

